    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The 12 rooms Assessment and Communication suite in CIME Nairobi is now fully equipped with the B-line Medical Debriefing System. This advance system provides faculty and staff with a one-window solution in planning, managing, and evaluating student performance during simulated practice and Objective Structured Clinical Examinations (OSCEs). With this implementation, CIME Nairobi becomes the first to introduce an automated system throughout AKU global campuses to manage OSCEs.",
